GeneralsX: pipeline creation counters for the game's frame hitch report.
The exported GeneralsX_GetPipelineStats returns running totals of the
pipeline instances the context created for draws (fast-linked from
pipeline libraries, or compiled completely when the state cannot use
them), the time spent creating them, and the fixed function shaders the
D3D9 device generated.

